<title>ZIMBABWE: Truworths raises interim shr, div.</title>
<headline>Truworths raises interim shr, div.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year results for the period ended January 4, compared to the previous six months</p>
<p>(all figures in Z$ million unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Shr	    38.9  cts  vs  30.1  cts</p>
<p>    Div	     8.5  cts  vs   6.7  cts</p>
<p>    After-tax    12.16	vs   9.39</p>
<p>    Pre-tax	16.21	vs  14.05</p>
<p>    Tax	     4.05	vs   4.65</p>
<p>    Finance costs 3.30	vs   1.25</p>
<p>    Turnover    139.39	vs 107.33</p>
<p>Div payable April 25</p>
<p>on register March 21</p>
<p>Full name: Truworths Ltd</p>
<p>Note -- The company said it was confident that a marked improvement in asset management and strong sales growth, already evident, would result in earnings for the full year of over Z$30 million before tax, compared to Z$22 million last year.</p>
<p>-- Harare newsroom +263-4 72 52 28/9 --</p>
